27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271550%27%20height%3D%272200%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-srcset="https://bestnestbuilding.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-7.11.58-PM-e1761719157642-200x284.png 200w, https://bestnestbuilding.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-7.11.58-PM-e1761719157642-400x568.png 400w, https://bestnestbuilding.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-7.11.58-PM-e1761719157642-600x852.png 600w, https://bestnestbuilding.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-7.11.58-PM-e1761719157642-800x1135.png 800w, https://bestnestbuilding.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-7.11.58-PM-e1761719157642-1200x1703.png 1200w, https://bestnestbuilding.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screenshot-2025-10-29-at-7.11.58-PM-e1761719157642.png 1550w" data-sizes="auto" data-orig-sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 1200px" /></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-5 nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling" style="--awb-border-sizes-top:0px;--awb-border-sizes-bottom:0px;--awb-border-sizes-left:0px;--awb-border-sizes-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-padding-top:40px;--awb-padding-bottom:0px;--awb-background-color:#59aa48;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;" ><div class="fusion-builder-row fusion-row"><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-5 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-one-full fusion-column-first fusion-column-last" style="--awb-padding-right:15%;--awb-padding-left:15%;--awb-bg-size:cover;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-column-wrapper-legacy"><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-4"><h3 style="font-weight: 300; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff;"><strong><i>Best Nest Building Company is a professional construction company with more than 22 years experience in the Auckland Building industry. Best Nest Building Company takes pride in their quality of workmanship, time efficiency, customer care and coherent communication with their clients throughout the build. </i></strong></span></h3>
<h3></h3>
<h4 style="font-weight: 300; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff;">Best Nest Building Co looks forward to working with you to build your dream home.Best Nest Building Company is a professional construction company with more than 22 years experience in the Auckland Building industry. Best Nest Building Company takes pride in their quality of workmanship, time efficiency, customer care and coherent communication with their clients throughout the build. Best Nest Building Co looks forward to working with you to build your dream home.</span></h4>
